# M-GEO-1 analytical twin for the STL cylinder canary.

Simulation mgeo1_analytic_cylinder D2Q9

Define U = 0.03
Define H = 1.0
Define cx = 1.0
Define cy = 0.5
Define R = 0.2
Define Re = 0.24

Domain L = 4.0 x 1.0  N = 80 x 20
Physics nu = 0.05

Obstacle cyl { (x - cx)^2 + (y - cy)^2 <= R^2 }

Boundary west  velocity(ux = 4*U*y*(H - y)/H^2, uy = 0)
Boundary east  pressure(rho = 1.0)
Boundary south wall
Boundary north wall

Run 50 steps
Output vtk every 50 [rho, ux, uy]
